  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.0 - Initial stable release\n      - 27.4x faster execution than reflection (verified by BenchmarkDotNet)\n      - Zero memory allocations vs 88 bytes per reflection invocation\n      - Compile-time code generation for ExecuteAll, Execute, HasSubscribers methods\n      - Support for timeout handling and conditional execution\n      - Mixed sync/async event support\n      - Full debugging support with visible generated code\n      - 100% optional and backward compatible",
